Aelix Studio host
https://github.com/handochan/aelix-studio-host

This is a modified version of AionCore (https://github.com/iOfficeAI/AionCore).
The LICENSE file is the license text distributed with the upstream repository.

Changes made for Aelix Studio are recorded as commits on top of the upstream
base named in scripts/release/policy.json. Each release's provenance file names
that upstream base commit and the release commit. The README lists the
categories of modification.
